  "heading": "Adjournment of proceeding.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 324,
  "text": "In every case in which a commission is issued under section 319, the inquiry, trial or other proceeding may be adjourned for a specified time reasonably sufficient for the execution and return of the commission.",
